ull,"qualifiers":{"source_term":"與次子謐、詵等","lineage":"paternal","source_syntax_qualification":"詵隨次子謐並列，次只限定謐；詵無絕對序號。"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009","quote":"及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009:m0188","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009:m0019"}],"interpretation_note":"完整收到來源語句與有限MID角色綁定；未知父母及缺代不補。"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBC","surname":"盧","ming":"詵","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009","quote":"及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","note":"盧欽具姓開篇及父子同一敘事承接省姓；不由ID尾碼拆姓，不加爵號作姓名。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture"}],"life_events":[{"id":"le-jin044-lu-005","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBC","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"date_expression":null,"source_term":"遇害","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009","quo